# Enterprise World Model Engine (EWM Engine) - Terminal Demo Tape
# Generated for charmbracelet/vhs (https://github.com/charmbracelet/vhs)
# Reproduce with: vhs assets/demo.tape

Output assets/demo.gif

Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 14
Set FontFamily "JetBrains Mono"
Set Width 1050
Set Height 640
Set Padding 24
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set WindowBar "Colorful"
Set BorderRadius 10
Set LetterSpacing 0
Set LineHeight 1.25

Hide
Type "clear"
Enter
Show

Sleep 800ms
Type "ewm example civicflow"
Sleep 600ms
Enter

Sleep 3s
Down@200ms 5
Sleep 4s
